Build an n8n workflow JSON for Signal v2.0 Task 1: Single-Zip Phase 1 Sub-Workflow.

REQUIREMENTS:
1. Webhook trigger that accepts: { zip_code, city, county, state, exit_strategy, buy_box_criteria }
2. Five parallel Perplexity HTTP request nodes (one per research agent)
3. Code node to collect all 5 responses and build Layer 2 analyst prompt
4. Claude HTTP request node for Layer 2 synthesis
5. Output node returning structured Layer 2 JSON

NODE STRUCTURE (reference v1 pattern):
- Webhook: type "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", httpMethod POST
- HTTP Request: type "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", typeVersion 4.2
- Code: type "n8n-nodes-base.code", typeVersion 2

AGENT TEMPLATES:
Read from ./research-agents/AGENT-*.md files - these define what each Perplexity agent researches

LAYER 2 PROMPT:
Read from ./layer-2-analyst/LAYER-2-ANALYST-PROMPT.md - this defines the Claude synthesis prompt

API ENDPOINTS:
- Perplexity: https://api.perplexity.ai/chat/completions (model: sonar-pro)
- Claude: https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages (model: claude-opus-4-5-20251101)

API KEYS: Will be inserted as "APIINSERT" placeholders (replaced during import)

OUTPUT: Complete n8n workflow JSON ready to import
